            "image_width": 300,
            "title": "Kid's Artwork",
            "text": "<p>At Lawton School, parents could participate in a unique fundraiser by encouraging their children to create original artwork. Our talented team transformed these creations into custom pieces available for purchase, with proceeds going towards Lawton School's initiative to bring a therapy dog on board.</p>",
