            "image_width": 300,
            "title": "Kid's Artwork",
            "text": "<p>Rebel Nell specializes in transforming your child's artwork into beautiful, custom jewelry. Instead of struggling to keep every piece of art your kid brings home, let us turn those cherished creations into unique, wearable keepsakes. This way, you can always carry a piece of your child's creativity with you, while decluttering your home.</p>",
